WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
What for?

2
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:06,240
I want to go to the hospital to see if there is something wrong with you

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,480
Just go find a human hospital

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,280
Loss of hospital and no treatment

5
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:16,990
You all stay here

6
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:21,110
Be ready to pick me up at any time. Mr. Qin Ke, please pay attention to safety and don’t attract loss.

7
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:23,820
Why don't you let me go alone?

8
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:28,460
Come back after buying the bomb and then sneak away again. You don't believe me so much. I asked you to go alone. Can you slip away?
